(tools/measurements.json) are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Credit for the instrument, when you share the samples or SFZ files (as they are,
changed, or converted to another format), for example:

  "Geoff's Guitar DI" by Geoffrey Waggott, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)

and say if you changed them.

Additional permission: music made with the instrument needs no credit. You may
use the samples and SFZ files to make music, sound for film, games, video or any
other recording or performance, and release, sell or broadcast the result,
without giving credit and without any other condition. The attribution condition
of CC BY 4.0 applies only to sharing the samples or SFZ files themselves, alone
or as part of another sample library or instrument.


